msgctxt "#30055"
msgid "Movie and series search uses the TMDb database (themoviedb.org). It is optional – Webshare search works without it.[CR][CR]You need your own free API key:[CR]1. Create an account at www.themoviedb.org and confirm your e-mail.[CR]2. Open www.themoviedb.org/settings/api and choose Create → Developer.[CR]3. Fill in the form (personal, non-commercial use).[CR]4. Copy the API Key (32 characters), paste it in the add-on settings, section TMDb Settings, and confirm with OK (Back or Esc discards the change).[CR][CR]A detailed guide including a sample of the form is in the add-on README."
msgstr "Movie and series search uses the TMDb database (themoviedb.org). It is optional – Webshare search works without it.[CR][CR]You need your own free API key:[CR]1. Create an account at www.themoviedb.org and confirm your e-mail.[CR]2. Open www.themoviedb.org/settings/api and choose Create → Developer.[CR]3. Fill in the form (personal, non-commercial use).[CR]4. Copy the API Key (32 characters), paste it in the add-on settings, section TMDb Settings, and confirm with OK (Back or Esc discards the change).[CR][CR]A detailed guide including a sample of the form is in the add-on README."

